{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lone Soul is a hack-and-slash action game featuring a combo-based fluid combat. By performing unique abilities, your combo meter gets upgraded, rewarding you with increased damage.\u00a0<br><br>A roguelite progression puts you on a multiple runs that takes you through a series of randomly generated locations, allowing you to craft a unique build with every playthrough. Killed enemies drop gear and health orbs, similar to top-down ARPGs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237360/extras/new_gif_01.gif?t=1744654667\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Express Yourself in Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During your excursions into the mythical tower, you will acquire dozens of spells and attacks to enhance your combo deck. Whether you favor close-quarters combat, tactical positioning, or commanding arcane forces, the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237360/extras/new_gif_02.gif?t=1744654667\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Three is Better Than One</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each of the three floors of the mythical tower is guarded by a powerful keeper, but to reach its core, you must face three daunting bosses. Yes, one by one. And then, yes, all three at once.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237360/extras/Gif_03.gif?t=1744654667\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">From Patron to Conqueror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of Varus, the overconfident yet powerful Keeper of Order, now taking the role of a tower conqueror, driven by the mission to rescue the beautiful Revelia. But beware, the Patrons are watching your every move, offering their guidance\u2026 or their judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237360/extras/new_gif_05.gif?t=1744654667\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">It\u2019s Finally Time to Gear Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every cleared room rewards you with precious loot that can be upgraded, traded, or even customized. The gear is fully randomized, ensuring each run feels fresh and unique while opening the door to limitless build possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237360/extras/new_gif_03.gif?t=1744654667\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3237360?t=1744654667","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744654667","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237360/066869af7e70336e0b62754760e6941673acd3f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744654667","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237360/066869af7e70336e0b62754760e6941673acd3f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744654667","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"descripti